.nf
Diva Comp V / Ampex 9300 partitions:
	disk	start	length	cyls	function on drive 0
	xp?a	0	9405	0-14	/
	xp?b	9405	9405	15-29	swap
	xp?c	18810	241395	30-414	
	xp?d	260205	250800	415-814	
